<type>(<scope>): <subject>

# --- Commit Type (必选) ---
# feat:     新功能 (A new feature)
# fix:      修补 Bug (A bug fix)
# docs:     文档修改 (Documentation only changes)
# style:    代码格式 (Formatting, missing semi colons, etc)
# refactor: 重构 (Code change that neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature)
# perf:     性能优化 (A code change that improves performance)
# test:     测试 (Adding missing tests)
# chore:    构建过程或辅助工具的变动 (Changes to the build process or auxiliary tools)

# --- Scope (可选) ---
# 建议范围: cpy, bit, add, base, build

# --- Subject (必选) ---
# 简短描述，不要超过50个字符

# --- Body (可选) ---
# 详细描述为什么要进行此修改，以及主要的逻辑变动

# --- Footer (可选) ---
# Fixes #123, Related to #456
